# H1 a `refuse` turn stopped by the user: while the gateway's port refuses
# every connection (15 s), Escape pauses the recovery -- fx's paused, then
# idle -- and the port is back before anything is asked again.
gateway h1-refuse-turns-long.json
wait 4
type say something
key Enter
wait 3
snap refused
key Escape
wait 1
snap paused
wait 3
snap after-pause
wait 12
snap end
gwlog
